5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us approach this trial with open hearts and a spirit of cooperation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Hello. I believe the most efficient way to find the truth is through the objective analysis of facts and behavior. Let's keep a clear head.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,Good day. I prefer to observe and think for myself. Trust is a fragile thing; it is better to be skeptical until proven otherwise.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with George. Trust without evidence is merely a gamble. I will be focusing on logical consistency and objective patterns in our dialogue.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! This feels like a big adventure! Let's all be friends and have fun while we solve this mystery together!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"A gentle reminder, Sakura, that while friendship is a virtue, discernment is a necessity. Balance is the key to a peaceful resolution.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,Indeed. Emotional responses can cloud judgment. I suggest we establish a baseline of how each person communicates to better spot anomalies later.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,"@Minako, your focus on efficiency is noted, but remember that the most calculated words are often the most deceptive. I will be watching closely.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, that is a valid point. Deception often hides behind a facade of perfect logic. I will look for the gaps where that logic fails.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, you guys sound so serious! It's like a detective movie! I'll be watching everyone with my super-duper observation skills!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is fascinating to see such diverse perspectives. Trust is not a gamble, but a bridge we build together, stone by stone, through honesty.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Honesty is a variable we cannot verify immediately. Therefore, I will rely on the consistency of data over the promises of individuals.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I have lived long enough to know that people rarely say what they truly mean when the stakes are high. I trust my own eyes above all.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, your idealism is noted, but in this game, it can be a liability. I prefer a system of verification over a bridge of faith.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you're all so grumpy! Maybe a little bit of trust will make the game more exciting! I'm sure we'll find the wolf!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us embrace the uncertainty. It is in the shadows that we learn the most about the light. I wish us all a night of peaceful reflection.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,I am satisfied with this initial exchange. We have established our behavioral baselines. I will now focus on the data gathered tonight.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I will remain cautious. Do not expect me to follow the crowd blindly. I shall make my own judgments in due time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I have noted everyone's stance. I will be analyzing the transition from these introductions to the actual accusations tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, sweet dreams!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
