33,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. I hope you all rested well. The air feels heavy today; let us maintain our composure and support one another.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,Let's begin. I've analyzed the Day 0 interactions. Sakura's openness is a contrast to George and Asuka's skepticism. Both extremes can be masks.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"@Minako, you are already trying to categorize us. Is that a search for truth, or an attempt to lead the group's perception toward a specific target?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, your analysis is too broad. Contrast is not evidence of deception. I am looking for contradictions in the logic used to justify positions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Everyone looks so serious again! Did you all have scary dreams about wolves? I didn't!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@George, let us not mistake a desire for order for a desire to manipulate. We must be patient with each other's methods.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@George, my goal is not to lead perception, but to organize information. Skepticism is a tool, but excessive skepticism can be a shield for the guilty.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,"A shield or a sword, it depends on who is holding it. I find it curious how quickly some are eager to point out ""masks.""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, you are responding emotionally to Minako's observation. While not a contradiction, it is a shift in your previously stated ""observational"" stance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, you're like a real teacher! But maybe George is just sleepy! I think we should look for someone who is acting *really* weird!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,Perhaps we are overthinking the silence and the noise. The truth often resides in the quiet spaces between our words.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I agree. Emotional volatility is a key metric. George's defensiveness is a data point. However, we lack a definitive lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,"@Minako, @Asuka, you both seem to be coordinating your scrutiny toward me. That coordination itself is more suspicious than my ""defensiveness.""","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Coordination is not necessarily collusion. It is the result of two people observing the same logical inconsistency. Your reaction is the evidence.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Everyone is arguing! It's like a big fight at recess! Maybe the wolf is just laughing at us right now! Teehee!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let suspicion turn into conflict. If we divide, the wolf wins. I suggest we vote based on the strongest evidence, however slim.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Based on the current data, George's reaction is the most anomalous, though not conclusive. However, we must make a choice to protect the village.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,George,,"I will not be a scapegoat for your ""data."" If you wish to vote for me based on a mood, you are failing the village's intelligence.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Logic dictates that we must eliminate the most likely candidate. George's shift from a passive observer to a defensive participant is the only tangible change.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, I don't want to pick anyone! But if everyone is pointing at George, maybe I should too? Sorry, George!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
