66,2,1,talk,Servas,,"A tragedy. George was a man of strong convictions, but alas, the village has spoken. We must now be even more vigilant.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Asuka,,George is gone. Minako was attacked. This suggests the werewolf viewed Minako as a threat or a convenient target to sow confusion.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Oh no! Minako is gone too! This is getting scary! Who is the wolf? I want to know now!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Servas,,"In times of fear, we must lean on each other. Sakura, your spirit is a light for us. Asuka, your logic is our guide.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, your constant attempts to soothe the atmosphere are becoming a pattern. It is a common tactic to deflect suspicion by appearing benevolent.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, don't be mean to Servas! He's just being nice! Maybe the wolf is just someone we don't expect!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It is true that kindness can be a mask, but it can also be a genuine shield against the darkness. I only wish for our survival.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, ""wishing for survival"" is a neutral statement. It provides no evidence of your role. Between you and Sakura, your behavior is more calculated.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Me? I'm just Sakura! I'm not calculated, I'm just curious! I think Servas is a good person!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I appreciate your trust, Sakura. Asuka, if you believe my composure is a sign of guilt, then you must decide if you trust your logic or your intuition.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I trust my logic. The werewolf and the possessed must work together. Servas's role as the ""emotional anchor"" perfectly complements a hidden agenda.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like this! But if Asuka says so... I'll vote for Servas if I have to, but I'll feel really bad about it!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
